WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.880
We first saw him running the fence line where the horses are kept.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.620
Yes. And then he came back later that afternoon when we were installing the swing.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.440
I hadn't mentioned we're swingers now.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.440
Oh.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.680
A large portion of our community enjoys swinging.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:18.020
Mainly the children traditionally, but recently we've joined a number of adults for a swing.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.720
We've swung with each other's parents once.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.530
How's the dog?

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:26.510
Oh, he was barely conscious when he first wandered over. Eyes barely open, just little slits.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.950
The tightest little slits.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:31.010
As he was losing consciousness, I began jerking him to keep him up.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.300
Two hands at one point.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.090
He had a fairly serious gash on his side once.

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.290
Clashed with a coyote, no doubt.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.630
Well, if you fight one of them, you fight a bunch of them.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:42.680
I was able to patch him up, but it took a lot of tender loving care.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.260
Let's just say I've had my face in gash for the better part of three days.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.250
Face and fingers.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:50.450
I swiftly retrieved my scissors and crafted a bandage for the gash.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.400
No one scissors like mine wife.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.310
Well, our daughters scissor quite skillfully.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:59.300
Now, credit where it's due. Our daughters learned to scissor from their mother.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:03.130
Teaching our daughters to scissor has been one of the great joys of my life.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.230
Look at me. I get wet just thinking about it.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.420
A D for Dick.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.710
An A for Anita.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.180
An N for Noah.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.970
And the tea leaves are in the shape of a dick?

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.000
Where's he now, Anita?

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.150
Is he confined?

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:21.600
We wrapped him in a blanket and laid him by a fire once.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.180
Well meaning folks, just a wee bit redneck.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.910
The children have taken quite a fondness to Sunshine.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.140
Sunshine?

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.780
Yes, the name we've given him, if only temporarily.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:33.500
We thought of calling him Monster for the sickness, living inside of him.

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:34.560
Monster Dyck.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.470
And he was so thin when he first arrived. We thought of calling him Pencil.

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:38.820
Pencil Dyck.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:42.660
We even considered naming him after Noah's late grandmother, Sarah Theresa Dyck.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.280
STD for short.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.500
What? Discharge? Discharge. Discharge. Discharge.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.280
At last we settled on-

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.000
His name is-

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:50.000
Sunshine.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.230
You're not supposed to give dogs human names.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.750
We'll be sad to see him go.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.210
I assume you's are here to take him back. Return him to his true master.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:07.670
I think we're not in front of. All right. Okay.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:08.210
Looks like we agree.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:11.550
How would you's like to keep them?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:20.510
Now, mine wife. You know, on Mennonite farms, animals fulfill only two functions t'werk and t'eat.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.600
But Sunshine is still healing.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.840
Joyful wife, joyful life.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.420
Alright then, he can stay.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.150
We'll continue to tend to him day to day.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:41.360
I'm surprised that my wife didn't become a doctor, for it would seem as though she can't resist an open gash.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:47.330
My husband knew I was many things when he married me, but I can assure you a gash lover was not one of them.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.110
It's true.

